  "prefLabel": "He-W 639.02 Subject To Available Funding",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 639.02 Subject To Available Funding. The services provided under this part are subject to the continuing availability of Temporary Assistance for Needy Families (TANF) funds as described in Chapter Law 342:9, 2018.\n\nSource. #12713, INTERIM, eff 1-22-19, EXPIRES: 7-22-19",
